{"id":"n65871-1-9","stage":2,"title":"승무원 · 乘务员","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n65871-1-9-1","ko":"엄마, 목말라요.","zh":"妈妈，我渴了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"엄마,","meaning":"妈妈","explanation":"엄마：妈妈。","readings":[{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67098","senseId":"1","lemma":"엄마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}},{"text":"목말라요.","meaning":"口渴","explanation":"목마르다：口渴；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"목마르다","audio":"/audio/9e9d0b9fcf45589e75fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55860","senseId":"1","lemma":"목마르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"목말라요","audio":"/audio/4a6cd5b94309d1a74b3d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"9498f9014908e289","term":"엄마","zh":"妈妈","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3","entryId":"67098","definition":"在非正式场合用于指称或称呼母亲。","pronunciation":["엄마"]},{"id":"9e9d0b9fcf45589e","term":"목마르다","zh":"口渴","audio":"/audio/9e9d0b9fcf45589e75fe.mp3","entryId":"55860","definition":"很想喝水。","pronunciation":["몽마르다"]}],"audio":"/audio/5cddc826a248ec1445e5.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n65871-1-9-2","ko":"그래. 이따가 승무원이 지나가면 음료수를 달라고 하자.","zh":"好的。等会儿乘务员经过的时候，我们就向他要饮料吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그래.","meaning":"好吧，是","explanation":"그래：好吧，是。","readings":[{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27656","senseId":"1","lemma":"그래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}},{"text":"이따가","meaning":"稍后，回头","explanation":"이따가：稍后，回头。","readings":[{"term":"이따가","audio":"/audio/aa70e42e378d2fb672d2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24813","senseId":"1","lemma":"이따가","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이따가","audio":"/audio/aa70e42e378d2fb672d2.mp3"}},{"text":"승무원이","meaning":"乘务员","explanation":"승무원：乘务员；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"승무원","audio":"/audio/662a49264e779b56857d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65871","senseId":"1","lemma":"승무원","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"승무원이","audio":"/audio/1ae7bd46f9949387e5f3.mp3"}},{"text":"지나가면","meaning":"通过，路过","explanation":"지나가다：通过，路过；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"지나가다","audio":"/audio/9c25392f9bf0bb82799e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60216","senseId":"1","lemma":"지나가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지나가면","audio":"/audio/f4a99bcbb5971ada2a60.mp3"}},{"text":"음료수를","meaning":"饮料","explanation":"음료수：饮料；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"음료수","audio":"/audio/aaae4e60029f5d1be170.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71113","senseId":"2","lemma":"음료수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"음료수를","audio":"/audio/30b33d27d9f6b7bbddbb.mp3"}},{"text":"달라고","meaning":"请求，要","explanation":"달다：请求，要；라고：引用命令或名词判断；要与前后引用表达连用。","readings":[{"term":"달다","audio":"/audio/bb552fc45699106762e3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62360","senseId":"1","lemma":"달다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"달라고","audio":"/audio/352f999287f8651495b6.mp3"}},{"text":"하자.","meaning":"我们开口请求吧（달라고 하다）","explanation":"달라고 하다：请求给自己某物；-자：一起做某事的提议。달라고 하자 是“我们向对方要吧”；既有引用请求内容，也有提议语气。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"31","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하자","audio":"/audio/04b9b32cf095cdd41c5b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"d39087dda3899d88","term":"그래","zh":"好吧，是","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3","entryId":"27656","definition":"用于回答，表示“会那样做，是那样的，知道了”等肯定的含义。","pronunciation":["그래"]},{"id":"aa70e42e378d2fb6","term":"이따가","zh":"稍后，回头","audio":"/audio/aa70e42e378d2fb672d2.mp3","entryId":"24813","definition":"过一会儿时间以后。","pronunciation":["이따가"]},{"id":"662a49264e779b56","term":"승무원","